      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"job creation\" part always sounds like a huge stretch to me though. like, the math on retraining millions of workers for these new roles usually doesn't add up in these models. can u give me a more realistic look at the actual disruption? i'm mostly worried about the immediate inflationary pressure and the cost to taxpayers.",
